Note, a menu bar, dialogs and mouse events in one small program.
Note, click anywhere on the canvas to draw a dot.

Open window with title Menus and mouse.
Add canvas board with width 400 and height 260.

Add menu File with options New.
Add menu item Save in File that calls save drawing.
Add menu item Quit in File that calls quit drawing.

When the mouse is clicked, do the following.
Draw circle at the mouse x by the mouse y with radius 6 and color pink.
End when.

Define save drawing, do the following.
Ask yes or no with the message Do you want to save your drawing.
If answer is yes, do the following.
Ask for a file to save as.
Say the value of chosen file.
End if.
End define.

Define quit drawing, do the following.
Say Goodbye.
Stop ticking.
End define.
